<title>POLAND: AMERBANK '96 NET JUMPS TO PLN 9.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>AMERBANK '96 NET JUMPS TO PLN 9.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.53 vs    1.23</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    2.75 vs    2.25</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  5.34 vs    3.18</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 5.76 vs    4.14</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  9.03 vs    6.48</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   16.61 vs   10.14</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 41.66 vs   36.99</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	52.04 vs   44.47</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Amerykanski w</p>
<p>Polsce Amerbank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
